msgid "No published FAQs are linked to this product. Nothing is shown on the site."
msgstr ""

#: src/product-faq/index.js:20
msgid "Product pages can also show these FAQs automatically as a tab. To avoid listing them twice, turn that off under SAAI Knowledge › Settings › WooCommerce."
msgstr ""

